* [ ] Team/shared vaults (basic RBAC)
* [ ] SSH Agent integration
* [ ] VS Code extension
* [ ] CI/CD service accounts (GitHub Actions, GitLab CI)
* [ ] Web app (Next.js + Go WASM)
