2. **Implemented `UnlockWithKey(vaultKey []byte) error`** in `core/vault/store/store.go` — needed by Phase 3 TouchID (bypasses KDF)
3. **Updated PRD deployment target** from macOS 13+ to **macOS 14+** (required for @Observable)

